QuickShulker263 (Itamio port for Minecraft 26.3)

This mod is an unofficial port of "QuickShulker" by kyrptonaught
(https://github.com/kyrptonaught/quickshulker, MIT License, Modrinth:
https://modrinth.com/mod/quickshulker), which quickly opens shulker
boxes without placing them down.

All credit for the original concept, design, and logic goes to
kyrptonaught. This port was created by Itamio to bring the
functionality to Minecraft 26.3 because the original mod has not
been updated to this version. The original source repository was
located and studied at https://github.com/kyrptonaught/quickshulker;
this port is a clean reimplementation against current Minecraft
26.3 / Fabric APIs (data components for shulker contents, custom
packet payloads, vanilla menu types) and does not depend on the
original's kyrptconfig or shulkerutils libraries. Creative-mode
bundling helpers from the original are not included.

Itamio does not take credit for any of the original assets or logic.
The code was updated to be compatible with Minecraft 26.3 (Fabric).
